{"task_id": "e22bb7e027fed409", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting Up\n\n**Equation 2:** $-4x_2 + 4x_3 = 8$ → divide by 4: $x_3 - x_2 = 2$, so $x_3 = x_2 + 2$\n\n**Equation 3:** $-2x_1 + 4x_2 - 4x_3 = -8$ → factor: $-2x_1 + 4(x_2 - x_3) = -8$\n\nFrom equation 2, $x_2 - x_3 = -2$:\n$$-2x_1 + 4(-2) = -8 \\implies -2x_1 = 0 \\implies x_1 = 0$$\n\n**Equation 1:** $3x_1 + 2x_2 + 2x_3 = 0$, with $x_1 = 0$ and $x_3 = x_2 + 2$:\n$$2x_2 + 2(x_2 + 2) = 0 \\implies 4x_2 + 4 = 0 \\implies x_2 = -1$$\n\nThen $x_3 = x_2 + 2 = 1$.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Eq 1: $3(0) + 2(-1) + 2(1) = 0 + (-2) + 2 = 0$ ✓\n- Eq 2: $-4(-1) + 4(1) = 4 + 4 = 8$ ✓\n- Eq 3: $-2(0) + 4(-1) - 4(1) = 0 - 4 - 4 = -8$ ✓\n\n{\"answer\": [0, -1, 1]}", "parsed_answer": "[0, -1, 1]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 10581, "usage": {"input": 296, "output": 630, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 234, "totalTokens": 926, "cost": {"input": 4.4399999999999995e-05, "output": 0.00031499999999999996, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.00035939999999999995}}, "cost_usd": 0.00035939999999999995, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "chatcmpl-aab39a98fd1dd534d0796c6cbc47dd66"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:27:22+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:27:33+00:00"}
{"task_id": "7e1d5aed4b26834e", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting Up Elimination\n\n**Equations:**\n- (1) 8x₁ + x₂ + 4x₃ − 6x₄ = −11\n- (2) −2x₂ + 5x₃ − x₄ = 7\n- (3) 8x₁ + 6x₂ + 7x₃ = 11\n- (4) −x₁ − 5x₂ − 2x₃ − 6x₄ = −14\n\n**Eliminate x₁:** (3) − (1) gives 5x₂ + 3x₃ + 6x₄ = 22 ... (5)\n\nMultiply (4) by 8 and add (1): −39x₂ − 12x₃ − 54x₄ = −123, i.e., 13x₂ + 4x₃ + 18x₄ = 41 ... (6)\n\n**Eliminate x₂** using (2), (5), (6):\n- 5×(2) + 2×(5): 31x₃ + 7x₄ = 79 ... (7)\n- 13×(2) + 2×(6): 73x₃ + 23x₄ = 173 ... (8)\n\n**Eliminate x₄:** 23×(7) − 7×(8): (713 − 511)x₃ = 1817 − 1211 → 202x₃ = 606 → **x₃ = 3**\n\nFrom (7): 93 + 7x₄ = 79 → **x₄ = −2**\n\nFrom (2): −2x₂ + 15 + 2 = 7 → −2x₂ = −10 → **x₂ = 5**\n\nFrom (1): 8x₁ + 5 + 12 + 12 = −11 → 8x₁ = −40 → **x₁ = −5**\n\n**Verification:**\n- (1): −40 + 5 + 12 + 12 = −11 ✓\n- (2): −10 + 15 + 2 = 7 ✓\n- (3): −40 + 30 + 21 = 11 ✓\n- (4): 5 − 25 − 6 + 12 = −14 ✓\n\n{\"answer\": [-5, 5, 3, -2]}", "parsed_answer": "[-5, 5, 3, -2]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 9599, "usage": {"input": 322, "output": 1569, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1038, "totalTokens": 1891, "cost": {"input": 4.8299999999999995e-05, "output": 0.0007844999999999999, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0008328}}, "cost_usd": 0.0008328, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "chatcmpl-8aa6dc19"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:27:32+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:27:41+00:00"}
{"task_id": "c5f4598586596232", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "From equation 3: \\(x_1=10-5x_2+9x_3-x_4\\).\n\nSubstituting into the other equations gives:\n\\[\n17x_2-39x_3+2x_4=19\n\\]\n\\[\n-44x_2+69x_3+16x_4=-187\n\\]\n\\[\n-22x_2+43x_3+7x_4=-80\n\\]\n\nSolving these yields:\n\\[\nx_2=4,\\quad x_3=1,\\quad x_4=-5\n\\]\nThen:\n\\[\nx_1=10-5(4)+9(1)-(-5)=-6\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\": [-6, 4, 1, -5]}", "parsed_answer": "[-6, 4, 1, -5]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 10921, "usage": {"input": 334, "output": 1570, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1398, "totalTokens": 1904, "cost": {"input": 5.01e-05, "output": 0.000785, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0008351}}, "cost_usd": 0.0008351, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "chatcmpl-8bc65b4e"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:27:33+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:27:44+00:00"}
{"task_id": "cd25df1322507d3b", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting Up\n\nI'll eliminate variables strategically. Using E2 (coefficient of x₂ is −1), I eliminate x₂ from the other equations:\n\n- **E1 − 11·E2:** 115x₁ + 93x₃ − 85x₄ − 40x₅ − 88x₆ = 119\n- **E5 − 6·E2:** 55x₁ + 38x₃ − 51x₄ − 14x₅ − 45x₆ = 131\n- **E6 + 5·E2:** −60x₁ − 36x₃ + 37x₄ + 12x₅ + 34x₆ = −51\n- **E3, E4** already have no x₂.\n\nFrom E4: x₁ = 3x₃ + x₄ + 11x₅ − 2x₆ + 11. Substituting into the four equations above and E3 gives a 4×4 system in x₃, x₄, x₅, x₆:\n\n- (B) 438x₃ + 30x₄ + 1225x₅ − 318x₆ = −1146\n- (C) 203x₃ + 4x₄ + 591x₅ − 155x₆ = −474\n- (D) −216x₃ − 23x₄ − 648x₅ + 154x₆ = 609\n- (E) −27x₃ − 11x₄ − 127x₅ + 29x₆ = 107\n\n## Eliminating x₃ (using row −27)\n\n- **D − 8E:** 65x₄ + 368x₅ − 78x₆ = −247  … (F)\n- **27C + 203E:** −2125x₄ − 9824x₅ + 1702x₆ = 8923  … (G)\n- **27B + 438E:** −1336x₄ − 7517x₅ + 1372x₆ = 5308  … (H)\n\n## Eliminating x₄\n\n- **13G + 425F:** 28688x₅ − 11024x₆ = 11024 → **1793x₅ − 689x₆ = 689**  … (I)\n- **65H + 1336F:** 3043x₅ − 15028x₆ = 15028 → **179x₅ − 884x₆ = 884**  … (J)\n\n## Back-Substitution\n\nFrom (I) and (J): the numerator for x₅ is 689·(−884) − 884·(−689) = 0, so **x₅ = 0**. Then (J) gives −884x₆ = 884, so **x₆ = −1** (checks in (I): 689 = 689 ✓).\n\nFrom (F): 65x₄ + 78 = −247 → **x₄ = −5**\n\nFrom (E): −27x₃ + 55 − 29 = 107 → −27x₃ = 81 → **x₃ = −3**\n\nFrom E4: x₁ = 3(−3) + (−5) + 0 + 2 + 11 = **−1**\n\nFrom E2: x₂ = 22 + 10 + 24 − 40 + 0 − 7 = **9**\n\n## Verification\n\n- E1: −5 − 99 − 15 − 15 + 0 + 11 = −123 ✓\n- E2: 10 − 9 + 24 − 40 + 0 − 7 = −22 ✓\n- E3: 12 − 27 − 5 + 0 − 5 = −25 ✓\n- E4: 1 − 9 − 5 + 0 + 2 = −11 ✓\n- E5: 5 − 54 + 30 + 15 + 0 + 3 = −1 ✓\n- E6: 10 + 45 − 12 + 15 + 0 + 1 = 59 ✓\n\nAll six equations are satisfied exactly.\n\n{\"answer\": [-1, 9, -3, -5, 0, -1]}", "parsed_answer": "[-1, 9, -3, -5, 0, -1]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 70274, "usage": {"input": 425, "output": 14101, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 13092, "totalTokens": 14526, "cost": {"input": 6.374999999999999e-05, "output": 0.0070504999999999995, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.007114249999999999}}, "cost_usd": 0.007114249999999999, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "chatcmpl-65ac6b64"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:27:44+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:28:54+00:00"}
{"task_id": "aed802a3c0a19460", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting Up\n\nI'll solve via Gaussian elimination. Writing the augmented matrix and using row 4 (coefficient 1 for x₁) as the pivot:\n\n**Eliminate x₁** (combining each row with row 4), then pivot on the row with x₂-coefficient 5 (from equation 6), then on x₃-coefficient −27, then x₄-coefficient −433. The elimination yields the reduced pair:\n\n- 19930·x₅ + 10917·x₆ = 145222\n- 1051·x₅ + 408·x₆ = 6652\n\n**Solving the 2×2 system:** The determinant is 19930·408 − 1051·10917 = 8131440 − 11473767 = −3342327.\n\n- x₅ = (145222·408 − 6652·10917)/det = (59250576 − 72619884)/(−3342327) = −13369308/−3342327 = **4**\n- x₆ = (19930·6652 − 1051·145222)/det = (132574360 − 152628322)/(−3342327) = −20053962/−3342327 = **6**\n\n**Back-substitution:**\n\n- From −433x₄ + 246x₅ + 154x₆ = 4506: −433x₄ + 984 + 924 = 4506 → x₄ = −2598/433 = **−6**\n- From −27x₃ − 89x₄ + 231x₅ + 71x₆ = 2073: −27x₃ + 534 + 924 + 426 = 2073 → x₃ = 189/(−27) = **−7**\n- From 5x₂ − x₃ − 17x₄ − 2x₅ + 3x₆ = 84: 5x₂ + 7 + 102 − 8 + 18 = 84 → x₂ = −35/5 = **−7**\n- From x₁ − 3x₂ − x₃ + 8x₄ + 5x₅ = −1: x₁ + 21 + 7 − 48 + 20 = −1 → x₁ = **−1**\n\n## Verification\n\n- Eq1: 1 + 70 − 70 − 60 + 12 + 54 = 7 ✓\n- Eq2: −7 + 84 + 7 − 18 − 32 + 12 = 46 ✓\n- Eq3: −6 + 14 − 24 − 36 + 36 = −16 ✓\n- Eq4: −1 + 21 + 7 − 48 + 20 = −1 ✓\n- Eq5: 10 − 21 − 70 + 36 + 28 − 12 = −29 ✓\n- Eq6: −2 + 7 + 21 + 6 + 32 + 18 = 82 ✓\n\nAll six equations are satisfied exactly.\n\n{\"answer\": [-1, -7, -7, -6, 4, 6]}", "parsed_answer": "[-1, -7, -7, -6, 4, 6]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 206963, "usage": {"input": 421, "output": 43132, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 42400, "totalTokens": 43553, "cost": {"input": 6.315e-05, "output": 0.021566, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.02162915}}, "cost_usd": 0.02162915, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "glm-5.3-flash"